<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―Echoing inside a dream, the sound of a clock.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I opened my eyes, the time had gone past midnight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Past midnight meant... 
{PAUSE ""}
today was May 6.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From tomorrow, it was school again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I opened my eyes, right in front of me was the TV―
{PAUSE ""}
the DVD movie we had been watching had gone to the menu screen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When had I fallen asleep...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe because I had slept sitting up on the sofa, my body ached a little.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\過去へ馳せる.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I looked to my right, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> was asleep, more or less leaning on my shoulder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Left like this, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> would end up even sorer than me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, late at night in early May, there was the worry of catching a cold as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\なつみ春花\なつみ春花起こす1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n3\r\n200\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-160\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n3\r\n200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-160\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, wake up. If you're going to sleep, let's go to your room."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shook <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s shoulder lightly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "2000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\なつみ春花\なつみ春花起こす2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\なつみ春花\なつみ春花起こす3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mmh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had she been sleeping lightly? <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> lifted her head right away, and slowly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? I fell asleep... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Damn... it was just about to get to the good scene."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> stood up and gave a long stretch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Damn, no good... Slacking off like this on the very first day of our new life..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Scratching her head, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> delivered a statement of remorse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Right now, there's only the two of us, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was probably no need to mention that I had been asleep too...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Just us, huh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yeah, that's right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There's no one to wake us up when we oversleep, like there used to be, and no one to look after us... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">anymore, either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s eyes were still sleepy, but her mouth twisted a little sadly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now there is no one in this home but me and <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My parents and <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s parents are never coming back again...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, remember? That I'm a real witch."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I had brought up was something I had not been able to forget, however hard I tried, this whole month.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―A silence of a few seconds passed between us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't think about that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a month now, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had been saying that to me every time, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
But, that person died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I as good as killed that person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had a feeling <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> knew something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I remember almost nothing of that time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, a year older than me, probably remembers more than I do.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that was an accident. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I know that feeling really well, getting it into your head that an accident was a curse or whatever. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But, that was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But, lately I think about it a lot. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If only those two had had a little more courage... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If they'd had a little more courage and chosen not to kill, today would probably have been a completely different May 6."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">but, it's all right just to dream, isn't it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That it would be nice if there were a life like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I turned to <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> with the biggest smile I possibly could.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well then, good night, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I went back to my room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The smile I had turned on <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> vanished the moment there was no more light falling into this room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know―regret is not going to change anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, never mind regret. The incident had been moving beyond my control.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was nothing I could have done.<PG>
My room was still lined with lots of boxes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Things I had brought over from my old home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those, too, had to be sorted out.<PG>
If those two had had more courage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that person had had the courage to endure.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had had more courage to fight back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If even one of those...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Then how would things have turned out?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
I thought back to a month ago, when that incident happened.
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
